Package: carozerra
Version: __VERSION__
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-pil, python3-numpy, wireplumber | pulseaudio-utils
Maintainer: Carozerra <amanbashir601@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/youxufkhan/carozerra
Description: Pioneer DEH-P7600MP OEL stereo visualizer
 A frameless, transparent, stereo-shaped desktop app that recreates a
 Pioneer car-stereo OEL display and plays decoded .lkd animations on it.
 The stereo's own controls work: presets switch clips, the volume knob
 sets system volume, the nav knob switches clips and animation speed,
 FUNC toggles retro glow, and ESC quits.
